  "body": "**Blocked by:** #120\n\n## Context\n\nThe owner needs visibility into the usage records and daily safety limit.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd authenticated `GET /api/ai-usage` over `ai_gateway_calls` with bounded date range and aggregates separated by provider, model, native unit, and `agent_runs.unit`. Add a Semprec System page Utilization graph for cost and token usage, with an explicit daily-budget reference line and clear representation of uncapped monthly budget and audio-only calls. Use shared client/i18n/loading/error patterns.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Read endpoint, aggregation, graph, cap line, empty/error states.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Budget editing UI beyond the existing Settings property editor and per-project analytics.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Endpoint totals match persisted calls and do not treat null tokens as zero events.\n- Graph separates incomparable invocation/session units where applicable.\n- Empty usage and cap-exceeded periods are understandable.\n",
